    "items": [
      {
        "question": "How does the 90% cost reduction work?",
        "answer": "We intelligently route simple analyses to free local LLMs (Ollama) and only use paid cloud APIs for complex code. This reduces costs from $0.50/analysis to $0.01/analysis."
